          <div class="cred-card" data-num="ii"><div class="cred-key">$username</div><div class="cred-label">Ποιος συνδέεται;</div><div class="cred-val">"root"</div><div class="cred-desc">Ο default super-χρήστης του XAMPP.</div></div>
          <div class="cred-card" data-num="iii"><div class="cred-key">$password</div><div class="cred-label">Με ποιον κωδικό;</div><div class="cred-val empty">"" (κενό)</div><div class="cred-desc">Στο XAMPP, ο root δεν έχει password.</div></div>
