  </section>

  <!-- ===== STEP 8: mysqli_query ===== -->
  <section class="step" data-step="8">
    <div class="stage-grid">
      <div class="stage-text">
        <div class="step-label"><span class="step-num-badge">08</span> Αποστολή ερωτήματος</div>
        <h2>Στέλνουμε SQL με <em>mysqli_query()</em></h2>
        <p>Η PHP δεν ξέρει από μόνη της πώς να ψάξει στους πίνακες. Αυτό που κάνει είναι να μεταφέρει το μήνυμά μας (το SQL ερώτημα) στον διακομιστή της MySQL και να περιμένει την απάντηση.</p>
        <p>Η <code>mysqli_query()</code> δέχεται δύο ορίσματα: τη σύνδεση <code>$conn</code> και το κείμενο του ερωτήματος. Η απάντηση επιστρέφεται ως ένα ειδικό <strong>result set</strong> — δεν είναι πίνακας ακόμα, αλλά τα δεδομένα μας σε συμπιεσμένη μορφή.</p>
        <div class="callout warn">
          <div class="callout-icon">!</div>
          <p>Η μεταβλητή <code>$result</code> είναι σαν ένας σφραγισμένος φάκελος με τις απαντήσεις της βάσης — θα τον αποκωδικοποιήσουμε στα επόμενα βήματα.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="visual-panel">
        <span class="visual-label">query → result</span>
        <div class="qflow">
          <div class="qflow-side php"><div class="qflow-tag">PHP</div><div class="qflow-icon">&lt;?php?&gt;</div><div class="qflow-sub">$conn</div></div>
          <div class="qflow-mid">
            <div class="qflow-arrow send"><span class="qflow-arrow-label">$sql</span><span class="qflow-packet q">SELECT *</span></div>
            <div class="qflow-arrow recv"><span class="qflow-arrow-label">$result</span><span class="qflow-packet r">rows</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="qflow-side db"><div class="qflow-tag">MySQL</div><div class="qflow-icon">my_shop</div><div class="qflow-sub">products</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header"><div class="code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><span class="code-filename">index.php</span></div>
<pre class="code"><span class="line"><span class="tag">&lt;?php</span></span>
<span class="line"><span class="kw">require_once</span> <span class="str">'db_connect.php'</span>;</span>
<span class="line"> </span>
<span class="line new"><span class="cmt">// 1. Γράφουμε το ερώτημα SQL</span></span>
<span class="line new"><span class="var">$sql</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="str">"SELECT id, name, price FROM products"</span>;</span>
<span class="line"> </span>
<span class="line new"><span class="cmt">// 2. Το στέλνουμε μέσω της σύνδεσης</span></span>
<span class="line new"><span class="var">$result</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">mysqli_query</span>(<span class="var">$conn</span>, <span class="var">$sql</span>);</span>
<span class="line"><span class="tag">?&gt;</span></span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== STEP 9: num_rows ===== -->
  <section class="step" data-step="9">
    <div class="stage-grid">
      <div class="stage-text">
        <div class="step-label"><span class="step-num-badge">09</span> Έλεγχος αποτελεσμάτων</div>
        <h2>Πόσες γραμμές μας <em>γύρισε</em> η βάση;</h2>
        <p>Πριν προσπαθήσουμε να διαβάσουμε τα δεδομένα από το <code>$result</code>, ελέγχουμε αν η βάση βρήκε καθόλου εγγραφές. Αν ο πίνακας είναι άδειος, το να προσπαθήσουμε να τον διαβάσουμε μπορεί να δημιουργήσει σφάλματα ή κενή σελίδα.</p>
        <p>Η <code>mysqli_num_rows()</code> μετράει πόσες γραμμές επέστρεψε η βάση. Αν είναι μεγαλύτερες του μηδέν, προχωράμε. Αλλιώς δείχνουμε ένα ευγενικό μήνυμα.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="visual-panel">
        <span class="visual-label">$result → number of rows</span>
        <div class="nrows">
          <div class="nrows-result"><div class="nrows-row">row #1</div><div class="nrows-row">row #2</div><div class="nrows-row">row #3</div><div class="nrows-row">row #4</div></div>
          <div class="nrows-counter"><span class="label">mysqli_num_rows($result)</span><span class="value">4</span></div>
          <div class="nrows-branch">
            <div class="yes">✓ &gt; 0 → εμφανίζουμε τα προϊόντα</div>
            <div class="no">✕ = 0 → "Δεν βρέθηκαν προϊόντα"</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header"><div class="code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><span class="code-filename">index.php</span></div>
<pre class="code"><span class="line"><span class="var">$result</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">mysqli_query</span>(<span class="var">$conn</span>, <span class="var">$sql</span>);</span>
<span class="line"> </span>
<span class="line new"><span class="kw">if</span> (<span class="fn">mysqli_num_rows</span>(<span class="var">$result</span>) <span class="op">&gt;</span> <span class="num">0</span>) {</span>
<span class="line new">    <span class="cmt">// Βρέθηκαν δεδομένα — τα διαβάζουμε</span></span>
<span class="line new">} <span class="kw">else</span> {</span>
<span class="line new">    <span class="kw">echo</span> <span class="str">"Δεν βρέθηκαν προϊόντα στον κατάλογο."</span>;</span>
<span class="line new">}</span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===== STEP 10: fetch_assoc + while ===== -->
  <section class="step" data-step="10">
    <div class="stage-grid">
      <div class="stage-text">
        <div class="step-label"><span class="step-num-badge">10</span> Η μεγάλη μεταμόρφωση</div>
        <h2>Από <em>γραμμή SQL</em> σε <em>associative array</em></h2>
        <p>Το <code>$result</code> είναι συμπιεσμένο. Η <code>mysqli_fetch_assoc()</code> κόβει <strong>μία γραμμή τη φορά</strong>, τη μετατρέπει σε γνώριμο πίνακα PHP, και προχωράει στην επόμενη.</p>
        <p>Επειδή φέρνει μόνο μία γραμμή κάθε φορά, τη βάζουμε μέσα σε ένα <code>while</code>: "συνέχισε να φέρνεις γραμμές μέχρι να τελειώσουν". Όταν τελειώσουν, η συνάρτηση επιστρέφει <code>false</code> και ο βρόχος σταματάει.</p>
        <div class="callout">
          <div class="callout-icon">i</div>
          <p><strong>fetch</strong> = "πήγαινε και φέρε" · <strong>assoc</strong> = associative array. Δες δίπλα την κίνηση: η γραμμή του Laptop "γίνεται" ένα PHP array.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="visual-panel">
        <span class="visual-label">Data transformation</span>
        <div class="morph">
          <div class="morph-h">Η <code>mysqli_fetch_assoc()</code> μεταφράζει κάθε γραμμή</div>
          <div class="morph-grid">
            <div class="morph-side mysql">
              <h4>MySQL · products</h4>
              <div class="sql-table" id="sqlTable">
                <div class="sql-row header"><div>id</div><div>name</div><div>price</div></div>
                <div class="sql-row" data-i="0"><div class="col-id">1</div><div>Laptop</div><div class="col-price">800.00</div></div>
                <div class="sql-row" data-i="1"><div class="col-id">2</div><div>Mouse</div><div class="col-price">25.50</div></div>
                <div class="sql-row" data-i="2"><div class="col-id">3</div><div>Keyboard</div><div class="col-price">75.00</div></div>
                <div class="sql-row" data-i="3"><div class="col-id">4</div><div>Monitor</div><div class="col-price">320.00</div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="morph-arrow">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 60 30" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M 5,15 L 50,15" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>
                <path d="M 50,15 L 42,9 M 50,15 L 42,21" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
              <div class="morph-arrow-text">fetch_<br>assoc()</div>
            </div>
            <div class="morph-side php">
              <h4>PHP · $row</h4>
              <div class="php-array" id="phpArray">
                <span class="ar-line"><span class="ar-br">$row = [</span></span>
                <span class="ar-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="ar-k">"id"</span>    <span class="ar-arrow">=&gt;</span> <span class="ar-v" id="ph-id">1</span>,</span>
                <span class="ar-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="ar-k">"name"</span>  <span class="ar-arrow">=&gt;</span> <span class="ar-v str" id="ph-name">"Laptop"</span>,</span>
                <span class="ar-line">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="ar-k">"price"</span> <span class="ar-arrow">=&gt;</span> <span class="ar-v" id="ph-price">800.00</span></span>
                <span class="ar-line"><span class="ar-br">];</span></span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="morph-output">
            <div class="morph-output-h">Το αποτέλεσμα στην ιστοσελίδα ↓</div>
            <ul class="morph-output-ul" id="outputList">
              <li data-i="0"><strong>Laptop</strong> — Τιμή: <span class="price">800.00 €</span></li>
              <li data-i="1"><strong>Mouse</strong> — Τιμή: <span class="price">25.50 €</span></li>
              <li data-i="2"><strong>Keyboard</strong> — Τιμή: <span class="price">75.00 €</span></li>
              <li data-i="3"><strong>Monitor</strong> — Τιμή: <span class="price">320.00 €</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <button class="replay-btn" id="replayMorphBtn">↻ Επανάληψη animation</button>
        </div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header"><div class="code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><span class="code-filename">index.php · ο τελικός κώδικας</span></div>
<pre class="code"><span class="line"><span class="kw">require_once</span> <span class="str">'db_connect.php'</span>;</span>
<span class="line"><span class="var">$sql</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="str">"SELECT id, name, price FROM products"</span>;</span>
<span class="line"><span class="var">$result</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">mysqli_query</span>(<span class="var">$conn</span>, <span class="var">$sql</span>);</span>
<span class="line"> </span>
<span class="line"><span class="kw">if</span> (<span class="fn">mysqli_num_rows</span>(<span class="var">$result</span>) <span class="op">&gt;</span> <span class="num">0</span>) {</span>
<span class="line">    <span class="kw">echo</span> <span class="str">"&lt;ul&gt;"</span>;</span>
<span class="line new">    <span class="kw">while</span> (<span class="var">$row</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="fn">mysqli_fetch_assoc</span>(<span class="var">$result</span>)) {</span>
<span class="line new">        <span class="kw">echo</span> <span class="str">"&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;"</span> . <span class="var">$row</span>[<span class="str">"name"</span>] . <span class="str">"&lt;/strong&gt;"</span>;</span>
<span class="line new">        <span class="kw">echo</span> <span class="str">" - Τιμή: "</span> . <span class="var">$row</span>[<span class="str">"price"</span>] . <span class="str">" €&lt;/li&gt;"</span>;</span>
<span class="line new">    }</span>
<span class="line">    <span class="kw">echo</span> <span class="str">"&lt;/ul&gt;"</span>;</span>
<span class="line">} <span class="kw">else</span> {</span>
<span class="line">    <span class="kw">echo</span> <span class="str">"Ο κατάλογος είναι άδειος."</span>;</span>
<span class="line">}</span>
<span class="line"> </span>
<span class="line new"><span class="fn">mysqli_free_result</span>(<span class="var">$result</span>); <span class="cmt">// ελευθερώνουμε τη μνήμη</span></span></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

<!-- ============ NAV BAR ============ -->
<nav class="nav-bar">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="prevBtn" disabled>← Πίσω</button>
    <div class="step-counter">Βήμα <strong id="currentStep">0</strong> / <strong>10</strong></div>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" id="nextBtn">Επόμενο →</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<script>
const TOTAL_STEPS = 11; // 0..10
let current = 0;

const STEP_TITLES = [
  'Εισαγωγή',
  'Εκκίνηση XAMPP',
  'phpMyAdmin',
  'Δημιουργία βάσης my_shop',
  'Στοιχεία σύνδεσης',
  'mysqli_connect()',
  'Έλεγχος σφαλμάτων',
  'db_connect.php (DRY)',
  'mysqli_query()',
  'mysqli_num_rows()',
  'fetch_assoc & while'
];

const steps = document.querySelectorAll('.step');
const prevBtn = document.getElementById('prevBtn');
const nextBtn = document.getElementById('nextBtn');
const currentStepEl = document.getElementById('currentStep');
const progressFill = document.getElementById('progressFill');
const progressText = document.getElementById('progressText');

// Build hero TOC
const heroToc = document.getElementById('heroToc');
for (let i = 1; i < TOTAL_STEPS; i++) {
  const item = document.createElement('div');
  item.className = 'hero-toc-item';
  item.innerHTML = `<span class="hero-toc-num">${String(i).padStart(2,'0')}</span><span class="hero-toc-title">${STEP_TITLES[i]}</span>`;
  item.addEventListener('click', () => goTo(i));
  heroToc.appendChild(item);
}

function goTo(step) {
  step = Math.max(0, Math.min(TOTAL_STEPS - 1, step));
  current = step;
  steps.forEach((s) => s.classList.toggle('active', parseInt(s.dataset.step) === step));

  const pct = Math.round((step / (TOTAL_STEPS - 1)) * 100);
  progressFill.style.width = pct + '%';
  progressText.textContent = pct + '%';
  currentStepEl.textContent = step;

  prevBtn.disabled = step === 0;
  nextBtn.disabled = step === TOTAL_STEPS - 1;
  nextBtn.textContent = step === TOTAL_STEPS - 1 ? 'Ολοκληρώθηκε ✓' : 'Επόμενο →';

  window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });

  if (step === 10) triggerMorphAnimation();
  else stopMorphAnimation();
}

function next() { if (current < TOTAL_STEPS - 1) goTo(current + 1); }
function prev() { if (current > 0) goTo(current - 1); }

prevBtn.addEventListener('click', prev);
nextBtn.addEventListener('click', next);

document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
  if (e.target.closest('button')) return;
  if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') next();
  else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') prev();
});

/* ===== STEP 10 morph animation ===== */
let morphInterval = null;
const products = [
  { id: 1, name: 'Laptop',   price: '800.00',  display: '"Laptop"' },
  { id: 2, name: 'Mouse',    price: '25.50',   display: '"Mouse"' },
  { id: 3, name: 'Keyboard', price: '75.00',   display: '"Keyboard"' },
  { id: 4, name: 'Monitor',  price: '320.00',  display: '"Monitor"' }
];
let morphIdx = 0;

function triggerMorphAnimation() {
  stopMorphAnimation();
  document.querySelectorAll('#sqlTable .sql-row').forEach(r => r.classList.remove('active'));
  document.querySelectorAll('#phpArray .ar-line').forEach(l => l.classList.remove('show'));
  document.querySelectorAll('#outputList li').forEach(l => l.classList.remove('show'));
  morphIdx = 0;
  setTimeout(stepMorph, 400);
  morphInterval = setInterval(stepMorph, 1600);
}
function stopMorphAnimation() {
  if (morphInterval) { clearInterval(morphInterval); morphInterval = null; }
}
function stepMorph() {
  document.querySelectorAll('#sqlTable .sql-row[data-i]').forEach((r, i) => r.classList.toggle('active', i === morphIdx));
  const p = products[morphIdx];
  document.getElementById('ph-id').textContent = p.id;
  document.getElementById('ph-name').textContent = p.display;
  document.getElementById('ph-price').textContent = p.price;
  const lines = document.querySelectorAll('#phpArray .ar-line');
  lines.forEach(l => l.classList.remove('show'));
  lines.forEach((l, i) => setTimeout(() => l.classList.add('show'), i * 110));
  document.querySelectorAll('#outputList li').forEach((l, i) => {
    if (i <= morphIdx) setTimeout(() => l.classList.add('show'), 600);
  });
  morphIdx = (morphIdx + 1) % products.length;
  if (morphIdx === 0) {
    setTimeout(() => document.querySelectorAll('#outputList li').forEach(l => l.classList.remove('show')), 1300);
  }
}
document.getElementById('replayMorphBtn').addEventListener('click', triggerMorphAnimation);

// Initialize
goTo(0);
</script>

</body>
